flowchart TB
    C["Contract envelope<br/>Version + semantic hash + dependency locks"]:::main
    T["Bit-vector types<br/>Widths, signs, endian, overflow"]:::main
    S["Bounded state<br/>8 instruments, 16 pending, one output"]:::main
    E["Event semantics<br/>Priority, acceptance, sequence, epoch"]:::main
    TM["Time semantics<br/>Every-cycle Tick profile or explicit-time profile"]:::warn
    F["Fault and authority policy<br/>Hold, reconcile, reset, activate config"]:::warn
    B["Boundary contract<br/>Normalized event or qualified wire protocol"]:::main
    VC["Semantic validation<br/>Reject ambiguity and unsupported constructs"]:::check
    PURE["Pure operation graph<br/>Comparisons and widened arithmetic"]:::main
    EFFECT["Ordered effects<br/>Read, reserve, commit, transmit, retire"]:::main
    OBS["Observable trace<br/>Ready/valid, order, rejection, authority, state"]:::store
    HASH["Canonical semantic identity<br/>Changes invalidate comparisons and proofs"]:::check
    C --> T & S & E & TM & F & B
    T & S & E & TM & F & B --> VC
    VC --> PURE & EFFECT
    PURE --> EFFECT --> OBS
    VC --> HASH

